    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stacks <computeroutput>inputs</computeroutput> along a new outer axis 0 to materialize the constructed tensor sequence. All inputs must share the same <computeroutput>data_type</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>shape</computeroutput>; the output has shape <computeroutput>[N, *inputs[0].shape]</computeroutput> and contains the concatenation of the per-input byte buffers. </para>
